      "content": "that's a pretty dark way to put it. but i guess you're not wrong. it just feels like i'm running on a treadmill that isn't even plugged into anything. everyone says it gets better or that you have to find \"purpose,\" but if the universe doesn't care, then purpose is just a lie we tell ourselves to stay busy, right?",
